drm/xe: spare costly buffers from the shrinker (linux-next)

From drm-xe-next, in linux-next for 7.4, for 7.2, which lacks them. The
series posted as 20261019095655.3501 (patches 1 to 4), in order:

846f333b3e0b drm/xe: Don't abort the shrinker walk on -EBUSY
2830e59a9268 drm/xe: Track number of populated ttm_tts in the shrinker
4ab4fb32bfbb drm/xe: Split the bo shrinker into purgeable and non-purgea
f4e86e1f5ab5 drm/xe: Update non-purgeable shrinker batch size based on a

